  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both transitively (パソコンを{起動|きどう}する 'start up the computer') and intransitively (パソコンが{起動|きどう}する 'the computer starts up'). Essential vocabulary for anyone using computers or smartphones in Japanese.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- パソコンを{起動|きどう}する (boot a computer)\n- アプリを{起動|きどう}する (launch an app)\n- {起動|きどう}{時間|じかん} (startup time)\n- {起動|きどう}{画面|がめん} (startup screen)\n- {再|さい}{起動|きどう}する (restart/reboot)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {立|た}ち{上|あ}げる: to start up/launch — more colloquial synonym\n- {再|さい}{起動|きどう}する: to restart/reboot — very commonly used for troubleshooting",
